Subject: [PATCH 13/14] Switch: the emulator's own threads can be kept on one
 core (RexSwitchFijarNucleoHost)

The GPU ring, XMA decoder and audio worker outrank the game's threads and preempted its rendering thread wherever
they landed. Each follows the chosen core from its own loop.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CGstJFihyJYNUGR3QC7gUu
---
